# TLSET r1: LIVE key assignments do not remap STUDIO. Key 0 is assigned to CHORDS B in LIVE; in
# STUDIO, HOME + hold key 0 still clears DRUMS A (the keys mirror the grid).
wait 300
songseed
press PLAY
wait 700
release PLAY
tap EDIT
tap SEL
key 0 down
turn PRESET 20 80
key 0 up
expect keyclip0 20
tap EDIT
press PLAY
wait 700
release PLAY
wait 100
expect clipused0 1
expect clipused20 1
press HOME
key 0 down
wait 1700
key 0 up
release HOME
wait 50
expect clipused0 0
expect clipused20 1
